WEBVTT

00:00.360 --> 00:01.920
As we close this season,

00:01.920 --> 00:06.060
I want to leave you with one final thought.

00:06.060 --> 00:09.940
The work you've done here, it's bigger than you.

00:09.940 --> 00:12.420
It's not just about getting your next promotion

00:12.420 --> 00:14.580
or achieving personal goals.

00:14.580 --> 00:17.580
It's about legacy.

00:17.580 --> 00:20.220
The leader you have become through this process,

00:20.220 --> 00:23.100
the leader who operates from a place of clarity,

00:23.100 --> 00:26.460
of purpose, who champions their team with empathy,

00:26.460 --> 00:29.700
who navigates change with grace and agility,

00:29.700 --> 00:34.380
that leader has an impact on every person you touch.

00:34.380 --> 00:37.480
Your clarity gives your team clarity.

00:37.480 --> 00:39.840
Your resilience gives them strength.

00:39.840 --> 00:43.360
Your alignment inspires them to find their own.

00:43.360 --> 00:46.800
This is the ripple effect of authentic leadership.

00:47.720 --> 00:48.880
As you move forward,

00:48.880 --> 00:51.800
I want you to think about this question.

00:51.800 --> 00:55.500
Who will benefit from the leader I have become?

00:56.500 --> 00:59.660
Your M.V.P. isn't just a blueprint for your own success.

00:59.660 --> 01:04.500
It's a blueprint for the impact you will have on the world.

01:05.340 --> 01:09.660
And now we want you to share a piece of that impact.

01:09.660 --> 01:12.540
We invite you to our wall of fame

01:12.540 --> 01:17.540
to tell us about a win or a key moment from this experience.

01:17.940 --> 01:21.540
Think about a specific before and after moment.

01:21.540 --> 01:24.060
How did you handle a challenge differently?

01:24.180 --> 01:26.140
Did you make a different choice?

01:26.140 --> 01:29.860
Did you see change in yourself or your team?

01:29.860 --> 01:34.300
You see, your story of transformation is powerful.

01:34.300 --> 01:37.300
It's not only solidifying your journey,

01:37.300 --> 01:40.380
but it also is inspiring the next wave of leaders

01:40.380 --> 01:42.420
who will come after you.

01:42.420 --> 01:44.400
This is your legacy.

